 accountsservice,
 passwd,
 libpam-runtime,
 procps,
 systemd,
Description: Wild OS first boot setup
 The one-time session a newly installed computer starts in: it joins
 Wi-Fi, sets the time zone and creates the first account, then signs in to
 it. Runs as a locked system user in a compositor showing nothing but the
 setup pages, with a small root service, checked by polkit, for the steps
 that need root.
